So this is kind of this U pi star, the optimal policy, but you also abbreviate this U of S.

35:37.040 --> 35:39.320
OK, so how does this now actually look like?

35:39.320 --> 35:49.800
So the utility of the state, and this is basically the same derivation step that we had done before, except as we are maximizing the function now and not the art max.

35:49.800 --> 35:52.600
So I'm not interested in the argument, I'm interested in the maximum value.

35:53.880 --> 35:58.040
I can again break up the utility at the reward and the utility of the future reward.

